   "widgets_values": [
    "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the person whose complete visual identity comes from <Picture 1>.\n<Video 1> provides the full performance, body motion, posture changes, timing, rhythm, spatial trajectory, camera behavior and framing.\n\nsummary:\n[reference generation] <Subject 1> performs the complete action from <Video 1>. Identity, face, hair, styling and appearance stay those of <Picture 1> from the first to the last frame; motion, timing and camera follow <Video 1>.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears throughout [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - Preserve the face, body appearance, proportions, styling, identity and overall visual presence defined by <Picture 1> throughout the complete sequence.\n<Video 1> (performance and temporal structure): attribute_transfer - Transfer the full body motion, pose flow, posture changes, timing, rhythm, spatial trajectory, camera movement and framing to <Subject 1>.\n\ndetailed_description:\nPhotorealistic cinematic video with stable character identity and natural continuous motion.\n\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1> performs the complete action from <Video 1>, following the same movement sequence, posture changes, pace and timing. Face, hair, silhouette and styling remain those of <Picture 1> from the beginning to the final frame."
   ],
